Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Notifications|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Notifications|
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
		|portletName|Documents and Media|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument enable Actions Menu On Portlet
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And Click at locator 'Icon#DISPLAY_STYLE_DESCRIPTIVE'
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|password|password|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	Then User assign Regular Role CP
		|roleTitle|Administrator|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: View No Website Notification For New Document In Folder
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	When NotificationsPortlet goto Notification Delivery
		|notificationCount|0|
	And IFrame select Configuration Frame
	And NotificationsPortlet disable User Deliveries
		|actionType|Adds|
		|contentType|Documents and Media|
		|notificationType|Website|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And DMFolder add PG
		|dmFolderDescription|DM Folder Description|
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
	And DMPortlet set Descriptive View
	And DMNavigator goto Folder
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
	And DMFolder subscribe PG
	And Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|0|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And DMPortlet set Descriptive View
	And DMNavigator goto Folder
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
	And DMDocument add PG
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.docx|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|0|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
	Then Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|0|
